  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Peace in Yemen Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Building Peace in Yemen program will encourage people to build mutual understanding, trust, and empathy in order to heal divisions, including those rooted in religious, ethnic, or political differences. The program will also promote climate resilience and help reduce violent conflict stemming from scarce resources.</narrative>
  </description>
